  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Women&#x2019;s Political Participation in Viet Nam&#x2019;s Elected Bodies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to bolster national institutional capacity to promote women in Viet Nam&#x2019;s elected bodies, accompany elected women in building their public policy, leadership and lawmaking skills, and influence public opinion in the leadup to the critical juncture of the 2026 elections. Across these areas, the project will create opportunities for national partners to learn from Canada&#x2019;s experience in advancing the representation of women in national and subnational governance. Such efforts will</narrative>
  </description>
